    "id": "silah-khan",
    "name": "Silah Khan",
    "role": "Chief Editor",
    "group": "leadership",
    "photo": "silah-khan.webp",
    "order": 1,
    "bio": "Meet the person behind every curated issue theme and every detailed Editor's note. When not planning the next issue for the Youth Gazette, Silah spends her time reading and obsessing over fantasy and YA novels or watching another season of some web series. Her one true love is biryani. Sad songs with complicated lyrics and a funky beat are her jam. She is an argumentative dreamer and a person with strong opinions"
  },
  {
    "id": "danya-anas-iftikhar",
    "name": "Danya Anas Iftikhar",
